{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SecOC_00073","versions":[{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SecOC_00073","release":"R19-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SecOC_00073","release":"R20-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SecOC_00073","release":"R21-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SecOC_00073","release":"R22-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SecOC_00073@rel:R23-11#0e96aa1c","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SecOC_00073","release":"R23-11","content":"[SWS_SecOC_00073]⌈\nFor transmission of Authentic I-PDUs using transport protocol, the SecOC module\nshall copy the NPDUs addressed by SecOC_CopyTxData into the buffer of the\ntransport\nprotocol\nmodule.\nAfter\neach\ncopy\nprocess,\nit\nreturns\nfrom\nSecOC_CopyTxData.\n⌋(SRS_SecOC_00010, SRS_SecOC_00012, SRS_SecOC_00013)\nFinally, when the lower layer confirms the processing of the Secured I-PDU via\nPduR_<Lo>TxConfirmation (the result can be positive, if the PDU was\nsuccessfully sent or negative if a transmission was not possible), the result is\nforwarded to the SecOC module and the SecOC module in turn confirms the\nprocessing of the Authentic I-PDU, so that the PduR module could forward the result\nvia <Up>_TxConfirmation to the upper layer.","meta":{"source_pdf":"SWS_SecureOnboardCommunication.pdf","source_page":46,"trigger_kind":"snippet_ingest"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","text_key":"654b48ccd5ca"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SecOC_00073","release":"R24-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/reco